  "(This dish contains ingredients you can only obtain in the retail version of 龍が如く 維新！)": "",
  "This cake is called a casutera, I think. It's so sweet and delicious. The perfect dessert!": "",
  "That's an omusubi, a rice ball packed with filling. They vary in flavor so I never know if they'll be good, but at least there's plenty of choice!": "",
  "Chirashi sushi! Sushi's always great, and it looks gorgeous too! I just love it.": "",
  "Teppo-yaki is squid that's either coated with spicy miso or stuffed with other ingredients and grilled. Sounds yummy!": "",
  "That bento looks like it'd make you really strong, maybe as strong as an ogre!": "",
  "A boxed meal so yummy I'd give it a gold star if I could! It has so many great items, it'd bring a smile to anyone's face.": "",
  "That's a basic miso soup. Reminds me of how my mother used to make it, with root vegetables. Really takes me back...": "",
  "Rice cooked with daikon. It's a great dish because if you don't have a lot of rice, you can just compensate by adding more daikon.": "",
  "This udon allegedly brings happiness. It's comforting to think the gods will just send you luck, but you gotta do more than just gamble and hope.": "",
  "That's a really spicy-looking hot pot. I wonder what happens when you eat it? Maybe I'll wait until I'm more grown-up before I try it!": "",
  "That's a really nutritious hot pot. I bet it'd be great to eat when you're troubled and in need of some comfort.": "",
  "Ah, umeboshi, you can't eat bento without it. It's great in ochazuke, too.": "",
  "Asazuke? It certainly perks me up when I see rice, miso soup, and tsukemono available.": "",
  "That stew is bright red, like a flame. But is it tasty? Looks like it. I'm excited to try some!": "",
  "That's a stew, the perfect nutritious dish that we should all eat to give us energy and keep us from catching a cold.": "",
  "This dish combines Japanese ingredients with western cooking techniques. So it's brand-new, yet still a tad familiar-tasting. I love it!": "",
  "That's a miso soup spiced up with some ginger. It can get boring to eat plain miso soup over and over, so this is a welcome change.": "",
  "That's a tray filled with vegetables. They're all super healthy, so I think you should eat them when you want plenty of nutrition.": "",
  "That's a dish of vegetables with dressing. Doesn't get much better than farm-fresh veggies!": "",
  "That's a dish of vegetables fried in oil. Is it similar to veggie tempura? Well, no matter what, it's rich and delicious. Should go great with rice!": "",
  "The star of the dinner table, a nice piece of salt grilled fish. The wonderful umami flavor of the fish goes so perfectly with rice.": "",
  "That's a hot pot full of fish. Looks delicious, with all that juice oozing out of them and into the broth! Hot pots like this are fit for a king, eh?": "",
  "Slice it nice and thin!": "",
  "Chop it up!": "",
  "Keep it up some more!": "",
  "Cut another in half!": "",
  "Chop another one up!": "",
  "Slice another one into rounds!": "",
  "Grill another one!": "",
  "Cut it all in half!": ""
 },
